OL,4,CTrump, Putin and Xi release 'peace     
OL,5,Cdeclaration' after historic meeting    
OL,6,GUS President Donald Trump and his      
OL,7,GRussian and Chinese counterparts       
OL,8,GVladimir Putin and Xi Jinping have     
OL,9,Gissued a "joint declaration of peace"  
OL,10,Gfollowing historic trilateral talks.   
OL,12,FThe three leaders met for 90 minutes   
OL,13,Fin China's south-eastern city of       
OL,14,FShenzhen, on the sidelines of the Asia-
OL,15,FPacific Economic Cooperation (APEC)    
OL,16,Fsummit.                                
OL,18,FWhile the presidents have previously   
OL,19,Fhad one-on-one meetings, these are     
OL,20,Ftheir first trilateral talks.          
